ight":35},{"text":"하나는","x":1406,"y":1585,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"전","x":1518,"y":1587,"width":29,"height":35}]},{"text":"송용이다. 따라서 각 레인은 4개의 선으로 구성되며 각 레인은 전이중 바이트 스트림으","words":[{"text":"송용이다.","x":304,"y":1640,"width":137,"height":35},{"text":"따라서","x":458,"y":1641,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"각","x":566,"y":1642,"width":32,"height":35},{"text":"레인은","x":612,"y":1641,"width":92,"height":37},{"text":"4개의","x":716,"y":1642,"width":76,"height":36},{"text":"선으로","x":809,"y":1642,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"구성되며","x":913,"y":1642,"width":119,"height":37},{"text":"각","x":1050,"y":1642,"width":31,"height":36},{"text":"레인은","x":1095,"y":1643,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"전이중","x":1200,"y":1643,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"바이트","x":1309,"y":1644,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"스트림으","x":1418,"y":1646,"width":132,"height":35}]},{"text":"로 사용되어 양방향으로 동시에 8-비트 바이트 형식으로 데이터 패킷을 전송한다. 물리","words":[{"text":"로","x":306,"y":1704,"width":33,"height":26},{"text":"사용되어","x":352,"y":1700,"width":126,"height":36},{"text":"양방향으로","x":496,"y":1701,"width":157,"height":36},{"text":"동시에","x":665,"y":1703,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"8-비트","x":770,"y":1703,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"바이트","x":874,"y":1703,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"형식으로","x":979,"y":1703,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"데이터","x":1117,"y":1704,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"패킷을","x":1223,"y":1704,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"전송한다.","x":1333,"y":1705,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"물리","x":1484,"y":1708,"width":62,"height":35}]},{"text":"적으로 PCIe 링크에는 \"x” 접두사로 표시된 대로 1, 2, 4, 8, 12, 16 또는 32개의 레인이","words":[{"text":"적으로","x":309,"y":1761,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"PCIe","x":416,"y":1764,"width":78,"height":29},{"text":"링크에는","x":509,"y":1762,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"\"x”","x":644,"y":1762,"width":42,"height":32},{"text":"접두사로","x":700,"y":1763,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"표시된","x":832,"y":1763,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"대로","x":936,"y":1764,"width":